        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you play as Mailey, who is looking to prepare herself some morning tea while waiting for her housemate, Derthan, to return. However, all the tea ingredients have gone missing, nothing is where is should be, and there are puzzles littered throughout the rooms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to carefully inspect her house, look for clues as to where things might be hidden, and solve a variety of puzzles to progress through the game. As you make more progress, Mailey will start to remember some of her forgotten memories, and by interacting with them, you will be able to uncover even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the memories that you will bear witness to may not be the happiest...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created by one person, and features an original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It contains a variety of different puzzles...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And several interesting characters that you talk with and learn more about throughout the game's runtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four different routes by which you can go through the game, affected by in-game choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can access a memory world which allows you to move further in the story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several different methods in which you can discover new  memories, encouraging different approaches on subsequent playthroughs, and increasing replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many hours of gameplay ahead of you if you're aiming to complete multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains a multitude of unique visuals, including...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A menu visual that changes depending on which ending you got last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be played entirely with just a mouse and keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It contains 8 different endings...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And 33 unlockable achievements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you play as Mailey, who is looking to prepare herself some morning tea while waiting for her housemate, Derthan, to return. However, all the tea ingredients have gone missing, nothing is where is should be, and there are puzzles littered throughout the rooms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to carefully inspect her house, look for clues as to where things might be hidden, and solve a variety of puzzles to progress through the game. As you make more progress, Mailey will start to remember some of her forgotten memories, and by interacting with them, you will be able to uncover even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the memories that you will bear witness to may not be the happiest...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created by one person, and features an original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It contains a variety of different puzzles...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And several interesting characters that you talk with and learn more about throughout the game's runtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are four different routes by which you can go through the game, affected by in-game choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can access a memory world which allows you to move further in the story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several different methods in which you can discover new  memories, encouraging different approaches on subsequent playthroughs, and increasing replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many hours of gameplay ahead of you if you're aiming to complete multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains a multitude of unique visuals, including...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A menu visual that changes depending on which ending you got last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be played entirely with just a mouse and keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It contains 8 different endings...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And 33 unlockable achievements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Mailey wakes up and goes to make her morning tea. However, something strange is going on inside her house, and her housemate Derthan is nowhere to be seen. Perhaps, the answer lies somewhere in her memories?",
